OL,3,AChannel smuggling gangs resort to
OL,4,A'mega-dinghies' as crackdown limits
OL,5,Asmall boat supply
OL,6,
OL,7,FA drop in small boats illegally
OL,8,Freaching the UK is forcing people
OL,9,Fsmuggling gangs to adopt new tactics, a
OL,10,FBBC investigation has found.
OL,12,FAnd there are claims of more
OL,13,F"mega-dinghies" being prepared, of the
OL,14,Ftype seen arriving on UK shores in
OL,15,Frecent weeks.
OL,17,FThe image of a 15-metre long small boat
OL,18,Fcarrying a record 230 migrants towards
OL,19,Fthe UK drew condemnation from both
OL,20,Fnewspapers and politicians.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
