OL,3,AAndy Burnham praises UK-EU ties in
OL,4,Ameeting with Emmanuel Macron
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are discussing "shared challenges"
OL,7,Fincluding the rise of "mega dinghies"
OL,8,Fcrossing the Channel illegally, which
OL,9,Fthe Conservatives say shows the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment has failed to "smash the
OL,11,Fgangs".
OL,13,FBurnham said it was "so fitting" that
OL,14,FMacron was his first overseas visitor
OL,15,Fin Downing Street since becoming PM in
OL,16,FJuly, describing him as "our nearest
OL,17,Fneighbour and close friend Emmanuel".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
